 "query": "Prepare a one-page briefing for a meeting with Shopify on 17 November 2026. Cover what changed in the last 30 days (news, launches, hires, deals), cite a source URL for every fact, and end with three open questions to ask.",
 "briefing": "# Shopify Briefing: 16 October to 15 November 2026\n\n## Bottom Line\n\nNo Shopify news, product launches, executive or key hires, or deals dated 16 October to 15 November 2026 could be verified. Every search returned no results, and no primary source was retrieved. Under the sourcing requirement, no item is reported as a fact here. The sections below list what must be checked before the 17 November meeting, and the closing questions are built around those gaps.\n\n## News\n\n- **Status: Unverified.** No Shopify news item dated 16 October to 15 November 2026 was retrieved. The primary newsroom was not checked directly: [Shopify Newsroom](https://www.shopify.com/news) [1].\n- **Still to check:** Shopify's blog and changelog for dated announcements, since neither was retrieved: [Shopify Blog](https://www.shopify.com/blog) [2] and [Shopify Changelog](https://shopify.dev/changelog) [3].\n\n## Product Launches\n\n- **Status: Unverified.** No product launch, feature release, or platform update dated in the window was identified.\n- **Still to check:** The developer changelog [3] and the blog [2] are the primary places where dated product changes would appear.\n\n## Executive and Key Hires\n\n- **Status: Unverified.** No appointment, departure, promotion, board change, or key hire was identified for the window.\n- **Current leadership:** Not verified. The company's leadership page was not retrieved, so no current names or titles are reported. Do not rely on names from memory without confirming them. Check the [Shopify About page](https://www.shopify.com/about) [4] and the company's [LinkedIn page](https://www.linkedin.com/company/shopify) [5], which is also the primary channel for hire announcements.\n- **Regulatory filings:** Officer and director changes are typically disclosed in Form 8-K filings (Item 5.02). None were retrieved. Check [SEC EDGAR](https://www.sec.gov/edgar/search/) [6] for Shopify Inc. filings dated 16 October to 15 November 2026.\n\n## Deals and Partnerships\n\n- **Status: Unverified.** No acquisition, investment, stake sale, share repurchase, commercial agreement, or partnership dated in the window was identified.\n- **Still to check:** Shopify's [investor relations site](https://investors.shopify.com) [7] for press releases and financial announcements, and the wire services where Shopify releases are usually distributed: [Business Wire](https://www.businesswire.com) [8], [PR Newswire](https://www.prnewswire.com) [9], and [GlobeNewswire](https://www.globenewswire.com) [10].\n\n## Source Reliability Notes\n\n- Two details from earlier research notes are not supported by any tool result and are omitted: a CIK number for Shopify Inc. recalled from memory, and a stated search budget that was not part of the task.\n- The research notes disagree on the number of search calls made (four invocations versus five or nine). This does not affect the findings, because no search returned results.\n\n## Open Questions for the Meeting\n\n1. Which news, product launches, hires, or partnerships did Shopify announce between 16 October and 15 November 2026, and where were they published? Our sources could not confirm any, so Shopify's own list would give us a verified baseline.\n2. Did Shopify file any Form 8-K in this period reporting officer or director changes or material agreements, and who currently holds the CEO, president, and CFO roles?\n3. Which announcements or events are scheduled after 15 November 2026, such as financial results dates or product events, and where will they be published?\n\n### Sources\n\n[1] Shopify Newsroom: https://www.shopify.com/news\n[2] Shopify Blog: https://www.shopify.com/blog\n[3] Shopify Developer Changelog: https://shopify.dev/changelog\n[4] Shopify About Page: https://www.shopify.com/about\n[5] Shopify LinkedIn Page: https://www.linkedin.com/company/shopify\n[6] SEC EDGAR Company Search: https://www.sec.gov/edgar/search/\n[7] Shopify Investor Relations: https://investors.shopify.com\n[8] Business Wire: https://www.businesswire.com\n[9] PR Newswire: https://www.prnewswire.com\n[10] GlobeNewswire: https://www.globenewswire.com",
